              "context": "Circular framework with straight terminal diagonals following the emblem structure. Left return uses shared external tangent toward the sweep (46.469 degrees); right return aligns with the lower loop on a shared internal tangent (48.190 degrees). Core stroke 60 and all nine 18-unit clearances preserved.",
